@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/notification
@adminToken = paste-admin-token
@recipientToken = paste-recipient-token
@recipientId = 1

### Create a notification as an admin. Set recipientId to the recipient's account ID.
POST {{baseUrl}}/post
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipient_id": "{{recipientId}}",
  "notification_type": "deadline",
  "title": "Writing assignment due tomorrow",
  "body": "Submit your essay before 17:00.",
  "dedupe_key": "writing-deadline-demo-1"
}

### Read the recipient's inbox
GET {{baseUrl}}/get
Authorization: Bearer {{recipientToken}}
